PRODUCT OVERVIEW
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Navly helps QA managers and food safety coordinators at small-to-mid-size
food manufacturing facilities (10-200 employees) prepare for third-party
audits. It replaces spreadsheets and binders with a centralized compliance
platform that stays up to date with regulatory standards.

Target user: QA Manager / Food Safety Coordinator
Regulatory bodies: USDA (meat/poultry) and FDA (all other food)
Standards supported: SQF Edition 9, BRCGS, FSSC 22000, Custom

