DATABASE SCHEMA (Supabase)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
facilities     : id, name, regulatory_body, active_standard,
                 audit_date, subscription_status, created_at
users          : id, facility_id, full_name, email, role (admin/viewer)
checklists     : id, facility_id, standard, element_code,
                 element_name, status, notes, updated_at
sop_documents  : id, facility_id, file_name, file_url,
                 mapped_standard, compliance_status, uploaded_at
gap_reports    : id, sop_document_id, facility_id,
                 gaps (JSON array), generated_at

RLS (row-level security) is enabled on all tables.
Users can only access rows where facility_id matches their own.

