Stage 9  : Settings screens (facility, standard selector, users)
Stage 10 : Stripe billing (Checkout, webhooks, feature gating)
Stage 11 : Pre-launch QA (RLS, end-to-end test, mobile, real SOP test)
Stage 12 : Deploy + go live (Vercel, domain, pilot customers)

